<addAttributes>
    <att name='institution'>Hakai Institute</att>
    <att name='title'>Weather Station Time Series, Hyacinthe Bay, BC, Canada (Provisional)</att>
    <att name='summary'>The Hakai Institute maintains a weather station on located on Quadra Island near Hyacinthe Bay. The weather station measures the air temperature, wind speed and direction, humidity, atmospheric pressure, UV radiation, solar radiation, photosynthetically active radiation (PAR), and precipitation since July 2012.</att>
    <att name='project'>Oceanography</att>
    <att name='comment'>##Limitations:
This is data is provisional only. Please handle with care.</att>
    <att name='progress'>tentative</att>
